<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Quiber!</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: "Arial", sans-serif;
        text-align: center;
        background-color: #f8f8f8;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
        background-color: #fff;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }

      img {
        max-width: 250px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      h2 {
        margin-top: 20px;
        font-size: 28px;
        color: #333;
      }

      p {
        margin: 15px 0;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #555;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <!-- Quiber Logo -->
      <div style="text-align: center">
        <img src="quiber_logo.png" alt="Quiber Logo" width="200" />
      </div>

      <!-- Welcome Message -->
      <h2>Hi <%= username %>,</h2>
      <p>Welcome to Quiber!</p>
      <p>
        We're thrilled to have you on board. Whether you're here to connect, create, or explore,
        we're here to support you every step of the way.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have any questions, ideas, or just want to say hello, don't hesitate to reach out to
        us. We're always here to help.
      </p>
      <p>Thank you for joining Quiber. Let's make something amazing together!</p>

      <!-- Closing Message -->
      <p>Best Regards,</p>
      <p>The Quiber Team</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
